{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:19cb4d6f90b162e9ba41d609831c1c24ba05d5d65a0161e5f0f56d72aec86a43",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39b1676ef773977d9d517f891d84c0cbc131938df717d15482ea861eeed3c118",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n辛苦啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cb38ca599a8c78d58d86da8e511d89dea2daed4bc1dcb36d999bcf3911af5da",
      "text": "今天吃了好多冰淇淋呢～。\n平时可难得有这种体验啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48aa95c5e43b645b020a89134ff5551fe55f3c34c4fcee4f0f30cabe48f67b24",
      "text": "拍着拍着，不知不觉就觉得开心起来了。\n从制作人酱的角度看，觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0530f45eb6c32e63009ddca3d7f59f79d9535fd3374789143e155b3721d43327",
      "text": "让人超级想吃冰淇淋呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff17e28949c87edf76eeeb70e35d69098a7494a768bc4b14acc0076a1e779671",
      "text": "次郎先生非常帅气哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74b63d1eaa1dc1d4f8efa883e757d4fe0e39bc6b5872b03e283a86893d0dcdb8",
      "text": "太好了。\n这样一来推广活动的效果就很到位了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff890acce7c5e35533aa67fbf81ac4a7279ba14f5cd2f4c8ff34d38837a60740",
      "text": "哎呀。本来想传达的是冰淇淋的\n魅力才对……算了，无所谓啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe00eec038ac6a6a80f3de03b2da63b714812d5a3029b44505be4fc4298fb449",
      "text": "不过大家也都真厉害啊。\n展现出了各种各样的表现手法，我都不由自主看入迷了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17624790eee95df35d5cd64aba32184c1dd5efa08c42c1d3dd2c932eeafd47dd",
      "text": "这次的工作真是彻底充满夏日风情啊。\n成了美好的回忆呢。谢谢你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1927e62b1f587112fa9ff88dda6e2a6717f1b1af3786d5ed2479c8bb7d3c4bbf",
      "text": "夏天还没有结束哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_402_2_4_037_02_09_b:2_4_037_02_09_b:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a5f14720ce6fa08edf52242bdb8b332937481c8619506bb7d12575080fc97bd",
      "text": "哈哈，这倒也是。\n接下来也继续多多关照咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
